#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:2
msgid "Configure SAML with OneLogin"
msgstr "OneLogin으로 SAML 구성"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr "|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced 플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:7
msgid ""
"The following process provides steps to configure SAML 2.0 with OneLogin "
"for Mattermost."
msgstr "다음 프로세스는 OKR.BEST용 OneLogin으로 SAML 2.0을 구성하는 단계를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-faq.rst:11
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:9
msgid ""
"See the encryption options documentation for details on what "
":ref:`encryption methods <deployment-guide/encryption-options:saml "
"encryption support>` Mattermost supports for SAML."
msgstr "OKR.BEST가 SAML에 대해 지원하는 :ref:`암호화 방법 <deployment-guide/encryption-options:saml encryption support>`\ 에 대한 자세한 내용은 암호화 옵션 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-before-you-begin.rst:6
msgid "Before you begin"
msgstr "시작하기 전에"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-before-you-begin.rst:8
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to generate encryption certificates for "
"encrypting the SAML connection."
msgstr "시작하기 전에 SAML 연결을 암호화하기 위한 암호화 인증서를 생성해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-before-you-begin.rst:10
msgid ""
"You can use the `Bash script "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/docs/tree/master/source/scripts/generate-"
"certificates>`_ from the ``mattermost/docs`` repository on GitHub, or any"
" other suitable method. See the :doc:`generate self-signed certificates "
"</scripts/generate-certificates/gencert>` documentation for details on "
"generating a self-signed x509v3 certificate for use with multiple URLs / "
"IPs."
msgstr "GitHub의 ``mattermost/docs`` 저장소에 있는 `Bash 스크립트 <https://github.com/mattermost/docs/tree/master/source/scripts/generate-certificates>`_\ 를 사용하거나 다른 적절한 방법을 사용할 수 있습니다. 여러 URL/IP에 사용할 자체 서명 x509v3 인증서 생성에 대한 자세한 내용은 :doc:`자체 서명 인증서 생성 </scripts/generate-certificates/gencert>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-before-you-begin.rst:11
msgid ""
"Save the two files that are generated. They are the private key and the "
"public key. In the System Console, they are referred to as the **Service "
"Provider Private Key** and the **Service Provider Public Certificate** "
"respectively."
msgstr "생성된 두 개의 파일을 저장하세요. 이는 개인 키와 공개 키입니다. 관리자 도구에서 이들은 각각 **Service Provider Private Key**\ 와 **Service Provider Public Certificate**\ 로 지칭됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:15
msgid "Create a OneLogin connection app for Mattermost SSO"
msgstr "OKR.BEST SSO용 OneLogin 연결 앱 생성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:17
msgid "Add a SAML test connector app."
msgstr "SAML 테스트 커넥터 앱을 추가하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:19
msgid "Log in to OneLogin as an administrator."
msgstr "관리자로 OneLogin에 로그인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:20
msgid "Go to **Apps > Add Apps**."
msgstr "**Apps > Add Apps**\ 로 이동하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:21
msgid ""
"Search for \"SAML Test Connector\", then select **SAML Test Connector "
"(Advanced)**."
msgstr "\"SAML Test Connector\"를 검색한 다음 **SAML Test Connector (Advanced)**\ 를 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:23
msgid ""
"In OneLogin, go to Apps > Add Apps, search for SAML Test Connector, then "
"select the matching result in the list"
msgstr "OneLogin에서 Apps > Add Apps로 이동하여 SAML Test Connector를 검색한 다음 목록에서 일치하는 결과를 선택하세요"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:26
msgid ""
"In the **Display Name** field, enter a name for the application, then "
"optionally upload an app icon. You can use the Mattermost logo for the "
"icon, which you can download from `Branding Guidelines "
"<https://handbook.mattermost.com/operations/operations/publishing"
"/publishing-guidelines/brand-and-visual-design-guidelines>`__ page."
msgstr "**Display Name** 필드에 애플리케이션 이름을 입력한 다음 선택적으로 앱 아이콘을 업로드하세요. 아이콘에는 Mattermost 로고를 사용할 수 있으며, `Branding Guidelines <https://handbook.mattermost.com/operations/operations/publishing/publishing-guidelines/brand-and-visual-design-guidelines>`__ 페이지에서 다운로드할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:28
msgid ""
"Enter a display name for the application in the Display Name field. You "
"can optionally upload an app icon. Ensure the Visible in portal option is"
" enabled, and save your OneLogin changes."
msgstr "Display Name 필드에 애플리케이션의 표시 이름을 입력하세요. 선택적으로 앱 아이콘을 업로드할 수 있습니다. Visible in portal 옵션이 활성화되어 있는지 확인하고 OneLogin 변경 사항을 저장하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:31
msgid "Make sure that the **Visible in portal** option is enabled."
msgstr "**Visible in portal** 옵션이 활성화되어 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:32
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:54
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:86
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:156
msgid "Select **Save**."
msgstr "**Save**\ 를 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:34
msgid "Configure the app."
msgstr "앱을 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:36
msgid "Select the **Configuration** tab, then enter the following values:"
msgstr "**Configuration** 탭을 선택한 다음 다음 값을 입력하세요:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:38
msgid "**RelayState**: leave blank"
msgstr "**RelayState**: 비워 두세요"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:39
msgid "**Audience**: leave blank"
msgstr "**Audience**: 비워 두세요"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Recipient**: ``https://<your-mattermost-url>/login/sso/saml`` where "
"``https://<your-mattermost-url>`` should typically match the "
":ref:`Mattermost Site URL <administration-guide/configure/environment-"
"configuration-settings:site url>`."
msgstr "**Recipient**: ``https://<your-mattermost-url>/login/sso/saml``. 여기서 ``https://<your-mattermost-url>``\ 은 일반적으로 :ref:`OKR.BEST 사이트 URL <administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:site url>`\ 과 일치해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:41
msgid ""
"**ACS (Consumer) URL Validator**: ``https:\\/\\/<your-mattermost-"
"url>\\/login\\/sso\\/saml``"
msgstr "**ACS (Consumer) URL Validator**: ``https:\/\/<your-mattermost-url>\/login\/sso\/saml``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:42
msgid "**ACS (Consumer) URL**: ``https://<your-mattermost-url>/login/sso/saml``"
msgstr "**ACS (Consumer) URL**: ``https://<your-mattermost-url>/login/sso/saml``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:44
msgid ""
"In OneLogin, select the Configuration tab to configure the SSO "
"integration with required values."
msgstr "OneLogin에서 Configuration 탭을 선택하여 필요한 값으로 SSO 통합을 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:47
msgid ""
"In System Console,  :ref:`enable encryption <administration-"
"guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings:enable "
"encryption>`, then select **Save**. You're redirected to the **Info** "
"tab. From there, select the **Configuration** tab to access the **SAML "
"Encryption** field."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 :ref:`암호화를 활성화 <administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings:enable encryption>`\ 한 다음 **Save**\ 를 선택하세요. **Info** 탭으로 리디렉션됩니다. 거기에서 **Configuration** 탭을 선택해 **SAML Encryption** 필드에 접근하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:49
msgid ""
"Paste the Public Key that you generated earlier into the **SAML "
"Encryption** field at the bottom of the page. This field displays in "
"OneLogin only when encryption is enabled in Mattermost."
msgstr "앞서 생성한 공개 키를 페이지 하단의 **SAML Encryption** 필드에 붙여넣으세요. 이 필드는 OKR.BEST에서 암호화가 활성화된 경우에만 OneLogin에 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:51
msgid ""
"In the Mattermost System Console, enable encryption and save your "
"changes. When you return to OneLogin, return to the Configuration tab, "
"access the SAML Encryption field, and paste the generated Public Key into"
" the SAML Encryption field. This field isn't visible in OneLogin until "
"encryption is enabled in Mattermost. Save your OneLogin changes."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 관리자 도구에서 암호화를 활성화하고 변경 사항을 저장하세요. OneLogin으로 돌아오면 Configuration 탭으로 돌아가 SAML Encryption 필드에 접근하여 생성된 공개 키를 SAML Encryption 필드에 붙여넣으세요. 이 필드는 OKR.BEST에서 암호화가 활성화될 때까지 OneLogin에 표시되지 않습니다. OneLogin 변경 사항을 저장하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:56
msgid "Enter the attribute parameters. The following attributes are recommended:"
msgstr "속성 매개변수를 입력하세요. 다음 속성이 권장됩니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:59
msgid "Name"
msgstr "이름"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:59
msgid "Value"
msgstr "값"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:61
msgid "ID"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml-onelogin.rst:61
